    "excerpt": "A personal petition in rhymed prose from the introduction to Vat. Ross. 499, an Italian-rite maḥzor from the year 1446 with a lot of very cool liturgical content in it. Frankly, the title drew me in.\r\n",
    "content": "<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">\nA personal petition in rhymed prose from the introduction to Vat. Ross. 499 (fol. 3r-3v), an Italian-rite maḥzor from the year 1446 with a lot of very cool liturgical content in it. Frankly, the title drew me in.\n</div>\n<hr />\n<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" class=\"draggable toggleable-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th id=\"x\" style=\"text-align: right;\">Source (Hebrew)</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Translation (English)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<span class=\"instruction\">זאת התפלה כוללת כ״ד דברים והיא תפלה מעולה ביותר</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span class=\"instruction\">This prayer contains twenty-four things and it is a really good prayer.</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nיְהִי רָצוֹן מִלְּפָנֶֽיךָ יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהַי וֵאלֹהֵי אֲבוֹתָי\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nMay it be willed before You, <span class=\"divine-referent\">Cause</span> <span class=\"divine-referent\">my God</span> and <span class=\"divine-referent\">God of my ancestors</span>&#8230;\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nשֶׁיִּהְיוּ חוֹלֵי עַמְּךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל נִרְפָּאִים<br />\nוְאַל־יְחַלּוּ הַבְּרִיאִים\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nthat the sick of Your people Israel are healed,<br />\nand the healthy are not sickened,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְהַצִּילֵם מִיַּד אֻמָּה הָרְשָׁעָה<br />\nוְדִקְדּוּקֵי עֲנִיּוּת וּמִכׇּל־מִקְרֶה וּפֶֽגַע רַע\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand save them from the hand of the wicked nation<br />\nand from pedantry and from all all accident and injury,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְלַחֲשׂוּכֵי בָּנִים תֵּן זֶֽרַע עוֹסְקֵי תּוֹרָתֶֽךָ וְשִׁמְךָ יְרֵאִים<br />\nוְתוֹצִיא מִמַּסְגֵּר כׇּל־הַכְּלוּאִים\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand to the childless, grant seed studying Your Teaching and revering Your <span class=\"divine-referent\">name</span>,<br />\nand bring out from confinement all the imprisoned,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְתִפְקֹד כׇּל־עֲקָרוֹת<br />\nוְתַתִּיר לְטוֹב כׇּל־הֶהָרוֹת\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand bring to mind all the barren,<br />\nand dilate all the pregnant for good,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְתִתֶּן טֶֽרֶף לַעֲנִיִּים וְדַכִּים<br />\nוּתְרַחֵם עַל־עַמְּךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל עוֹבְרֵי דְּרָכִים\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand grant food to the poor and thin,<br />\nand have compassion on Your people Israel passing on the roads,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְאֶת־הָאֲנוּסִים שֶׁיָּשֽׁוּבוּ<br />\nוּמַעֲשֵׂיהֶם יֵיטִֽיבוּ\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand that the forced-converts return,<br />\nand their deeds be made better,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְקָרֵב לָֽנוּ שְׁנַת גְּאֻלָּה<br />\nוְלֹא־נָבוֹא עוֹד לִידֵי תַּקָּלָה\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand bring to us the year of redemption,<br />\nthat we no longer come to fault,\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְתָסִיר כׇּל־הַדְּבָרִים הַמְּעַכְּבִים<br />\nתְּשׁוּבָה מֵעַל־הַשָּׁבִים\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nand remove all things that hold back<br />\nrepentance from those repenting.\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nוְעִם־עֲבָדֶֽיךָ תִּזְכֹּר עַבְדֶּֽךָ<br />\nאֲשֶׁר נַפְשׁוֹ וְטַרְפּוֹ בְּיָדֶֽךָ\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nAnd with Your servants remember Your servant<br />\nwhose soul and flesh is in Your hand.\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nבְּיִרְאָתְךָ וּבְתוֹרָתְךָ לְהַחֲזִיקוֹ<br />\nוְלָתֵת לוֹ אֶת־חֻקּוֹ\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nAnd in Your awe and in Your teaching strengthen him,<br />\nand grant him his portion:\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nלֶ֛חֶם לֶאֱכֹ֖ל וּבֶ֥גֶד לִלְבֹּֽשׁ<br />\nקְרָאתִֽיךָ אֱלֹהַי אַל־אֵבוֹשׁ׃\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nbread to eat and clothes to wear,<span class=\"footnote_referrer\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_1');\" onkeypress=\"footnote_moveToReference__1('footnote_plugin_reference__1_1');\" ><sup id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_1\" class=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text\">[1]</sup></a><span id=\"footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_1\" class=\"footnote_tooltip\"> Genesis 28:20&nbsp;</span></span><script type=\"text/javascript\"> jQuery('#footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_1').tooltip({ tip: '#footnote_plugin_tooltip_text__1_1', tipClass: 'footnote_tooltip', effect: 'fade', predelay: 0, fadeInSpeed: 200, delay: 400, fadeOutSpeed: 200, position: 'center right', relative: true, offset: [0, 0], });</script><br />\nI call to You, <span class=\"divine-referent\">my God</span>; let me not be ashamed!\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"liturgy\" lang=\"heb-Hebr\" style=\"text-align: right;\">\nיִ֥הְיֽוּ־לְרָצ֨וֹן ׀ אִמְרֵי־פִ֡י<br />\nוְהֶגְי֣וֹן לִבִּ֣י לְפָנֶ֑יךָ<br />\nיְ֝הֹוָ֗ה צוּרִ֥י וְגֹאֲלִֽי׃ <span class=\"citation\">(תהלים יט:טו)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\n<div class=\"english\" lang=\"eng-Latn\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\nMay the words of my mouth be acceptable,<br />\nand my heart’s ponderances before You,<br />\n<span class=\"divine-referent\">Cause</span>, <span class=\"divine-referent\">my Rock</span> and <span class=\"divine-referent\">my Redeemer</span>. <span class=\"citation\">(Psalms 19:15)</span>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h3>Source(s)</h3>\n<p><span style=\"float: right;\"><div id=\"attachment_68951\" style=\"width: 260px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vat--ross--499-fol--3r.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-68951\" src=\"https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vat--ross--499-fol--3r-250x250.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-68951\" /></a><p id=\"caption-attachment-68951\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">MS Vat. Ross. 499 fol. 3r</p></div></span> <span style=\"float: left;\"><div id=\"attachment_68952\" style=\"width: 260px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><a href=\"https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vat--ross--499-fol--3v.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-68952\" src=\"https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vat--ross--499-fol--3v-250x250.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-68952\" /></a><p id=\"caption-attachment-68952\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">MS Vat. Ross. 499 fol. 3v</p></div></span><span class=\"\" style=\"display:block;clear:both;height: 0px;margin-top: ;border-top-width:0px;border-bottom-width:0px;\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"speaker-mute footnotes_reference_container\"> <div class=\"footnote_container_prepare\"><p><span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"footnote_reference_container_label pointer\" onclick=\"footnote_expand_collapse_reference_container__1();\">Notes</span><span role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"footnote_reference_container_collapse_button\" style=\"display: none;; display: none;\" onclick=\"footnote_expand_collapse_reference_container__1();\"></span></p></div> <div id=\"footnote_references_container__1\" style=\"\"><table class=\"footnotes_table footnote-reference-container\"><caption class=\"accessibility\">Notes</caption> <tbody> \r\n\r\n<tr class=\"footnotes_plugin_reference_row\"> <th scope=\"row\" id=\"footnote_plugin_reference__1_1\" class=\"footnote_plugin_index pointer\" onclick=\"footnote_moveToAnchor__1('footnote_plugin_tooltip__1_1');\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"footnote_plugin_link\" >1</a></th> <td class=\"footnote_plugin_text\">Genesis 28:20</td></tr>\r\n\r\n </tbody> </table> </div></div><script type=\"text/javascript\"> function footnote_expand_reference_container__1() { jQuery('#footnote_references_container__1').show(); jQuery('#footnote_reference_container_collapse_button__1').text('−'); } function footnote_collapse_reference_container__1() { jQuery('#footnote_references_container__1').hide(); jQuery('#footnote_reference_container_collapse_button__1').text('+'); } function footnote_expand_collapse_reference_container__1() { if (jQuery('#footnote_references_container__1').is(':hidden')) { footnote_expand_reference_container__1(); } else { footnote_collapse_reference_container__1(); } } function footnote_moveToReference__1(p_str_TargetID) { footnote_expand_reference_container__1(); var l_obj_Target = jQuery('#' + p_str_TargetID); if (l_obj_Target.length) { jQuery( 'html, body' ).delay( 0 ); jQuery('html, body').animate({ scrollTop: l_obj_Target.offset().top - window.innerHeight * 0.2 }, 380); } } function footnote_moveToAnchor__1(p_str_TargetID) { footnote_expand_reference_container__1(); var l_obj_Target = jQuery('#' + p_str_TargetID); if (l_obj_Target.length) { jQuery( 'html, body' ).delay( 0 ); jQuery('html, body').animate({ scrollTop: l_obj_Target.offset().top - window.innerHeight * 0.2 }, 380); } }</script>",
